{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgttomas/chirality/pulls/892","id":4633492829,"node_id":"PR_kwDOShT4BM8AAAABFC19XQ","html_url":"https://github.com/sgttomas/chirality/pull/892","diff_url":"https://github.com/sgttomas/chirality/pull/892.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/sgttomas/chirality/pull/892.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgttomas/chirality/issues/892","number":892,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Refresh generated self-weight when authored mass inputs change","user":{"login":"sgttomas","id":15331132,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzMxMTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15331132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas","html_url":"https://github.com/sgttomas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sgttomas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Applied generated self-weight could remain unchanged after density or section edits, producing a solved result with stale loads. This change detects changes to consumed mass inputs and adds an explicit atomic refresh that preserves load identities, gravity, manual values and source lineage. Imported operations use the same before/after checks, so they cannot overwrite a manual change or declare a partial refresh complete.\n\nThe generator now uses stable source-dimension area calculations, with explicit migration from the historical generation method and lossless JSON quantity transport. The physical mass scope remains metal, contents and the existing exterior insulation layer.\n\nValidation completed on the reviewed source: 63 focused Rust tests; seven independent mass/API references and JSON parity controls; both maintained WASM builds; 20 affected app tests plus five separately identified mocked transport tests; TypeScript. Independent source review is clear, and current-main integration preserves the reviewed diff exactly. Full candidate CI, clean DEC-025, native workflow and final integration checks are pending; this draft is not merge-ready.\n\nEvidence: [implementation and limits](projects/chirality-piping/execution/_Coordination/AgentRuns/HELP-HUMAN-PIPING-20260918-UI-IMPLEMENTATION/instances/CONTINUATION_2026-09-24/GENERATED_LOADS_MANAGER/RETURN.md), [independent source review](projects/chirality-piping/execution/_Coordination/AgentRuns/HELP-HUMAN-PIPING-20260918-UI-IMPLEMENTATION/instances/CONTINUATION_2026-09-24/GENERATED_LOADS_MANAGER/review/RETURN.md), [final runtime evidence backcheck](projects/chirality-piping/execution/_Coordination/AgentRuns/HELP-HUMAN-PIPING-20260918-UI-IMPLEMENTATION/instances/CONTINUATION_2026-09-24/GENERATED_LOADS_MANAGER/ROOT_INTEGRATION/FINAL_RUNTIME_BACKCHECK.md).\n\nPart of the existing Piping correctness undertaking, principally M35 with a shared stable-area/M34 transport dependency. Broader M30 mass modelling, numerical and pressure corrections, engineering acceptance and release remain separate.\n","created_at":"2026-09-25T02:56:49Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T03:33:49Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a99837206efb2603d9016b3e058e96dd55fdd39a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgttomas/chirality/pulls/892/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sgttomas/chirality/pulls/892/comments","review_comment_url":"http